---
title: "join_rebate_balance (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_type: self, rebates
    q_get_type --> q_check: coin_type = type_name::with_defining_ids()
    q_check --> q_join: self.rebates.contains(coin_type)
    q_check --> q_add: !self.rebates.contains(coin_type)
    q_join --> [*]: balance.join(rebates)
    q_add --> [*]: self.rebates.add(coin_type, rebates)

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: Existing coin type balances are merged via join
        INV-002: New coin types are added to the bag as new entries
        INV-003: Total balance in bag must equal sum of all user rebate records for that coin type
    end note
